              "width": 880,
              "height": 55,
              "rotate": 0,
              "content": "<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#1e3a5f;\">二次函数的定义与图像特征</span></strong></p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#1e3a5f",
              "lineHeight": 1.4,
              "paragraphSpace": 0,
              "textType": "title"
            },
            {
              "id": "el_7sZrRjeC",
              "type": "text",
              "left": 60,
              "top": 120,
              "width": 880,
              "height": 400,
              "rotate": 0,
              "content": "<p>### 2. $a$、$b$、$c$ 的几何意义</p><p>- <strong>$a$（二次项系数）</strong>：决定抛物线的<strong>开口方向</strong>和<strong>开口大小</strong>。</p><p>  - $a &gt; 0$：开口向上；$a &lt; 0$：开口向下。</p><p>  - $|a|$ 越大，开口越窄（曲线更陡）；$|a|$ 越小，开口越宽。</p><p>- <strong>$b$（一次项系数）</strong>：与 $a$ 共同决定抛物线的<strong>对称轴位置</strong>。对称轴公式为：</p><p>  $$x = -\\frac{b}{2a}$$</p><p>  注意：$b$ 单独不直接决定对称轴的左右偏移，需结合 $a$ 的符号。</p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#333333",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "paragraphSpace": 6,
              "textType": "content"
            }
          ],
          "background": {
            "type": "solid",
            "color": "#ffffff"
          },
          "type": "content"
        }
      },
      "createdAt": 1781591783152,
      "updatedAt": 1781591783152
