              "rotate": 0,
              "content": "<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#1e3a5f;\">二次函数的定义与图像特征</span></strong></p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#1e3a5f",
              "lineHeight": 1.4,
              "paragraphSpace": 0,
              "textType": "title"
            },
            {
              "id": "el_mhc5D9SE",
              "type": "text",
              "left": 60,
              "top": 120,
              "width": 880,
              "height": 400,
              "rotate": 0,
              "content": "<p>- <strong>$c$（常数项）</strong>：抛物线在 $y$ 轴上的<strong>截距</strong>，即抛物线与 $y$ 轴的交点为 $(0, c)$。</p><p>- <strong>顶点坐标</strong>：</p><p>  $$\\text{顶点}\\left(-\\frac{b}{2a},\\; \\frac{4ac - b^2}{4a}\\right)$$</p><p>  顶点是抛物线的最高点（开口向下）或最低点（开口向上）。</p><p><strong>易错点</strong>：</p><p>- 误认为 $b$ 的符号直接决定对称轴在 $y$ 轴左侧或右侧。实际上对称轴为 $x = -\\frac{b}{2a}$，需要同时考虑 $a$ 的符号。</p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#333333",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "paragraphSpace": 6,
              "textType": "content"
            }
          ],
          "background": {
