              "rotate": 0,
              "content": "<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#1e3a5f;\">二次函数的定义与图像特征</span></strong></p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#1e3a5f",
              "lineHeight": 1.4,
              "paragraphSpace": 0,
              "textType": "title"
            },
            {
              "id": "el_ATBF9yLN",
              "type": "text",
              "left": 60,
              "top": 120,
              "width": 880,
              "height": 400,
              "rotate": 0,
              "content": "<p>### 易错点总结</p><p>1. <strong>忽略 $a \\neq 0$</strong>：判断一个函数是否为二次函数时，必须确保 $a \\neq 0$。</p><p>2. <strong>混淆对称轴符号</strong>：对称轴是 $x = -\\frac{b}{2a}$，不要忘记负号。</p><p>3. <strong>顶点坐标符号错误</strong>：顶点横坐标是 $-\\frac{b}{2a}$，纵坐标用 $\\frac{4ac - b^2}{4a}$ 或代入法计算。</p><p>4. <strong>开口方向与 $a$ 的关系</strong>：$a &gt; 0$ 开口向上，$a &lt; 0$ 开口向下，不要与图像上下平移混淆。</p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#333333",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "paragraphSpace": 6,
              "textType": "content"
            }
          ],
          "background": {
            "type": "solid",
            "color": "#ffffff"
          },
          "type": "content"
        }
