    {
      "id": "scene_fI9yAMDZ",
      "stageId": "stage_5uTHCgHS",
      "type": "slide",
      "title": "求二次函数解析式（待定系数法） (2)",
      "order": 8,
      "content": {
        "type": "slide",
        "canvas": {
          "id": "slide_JCCTqauf",
          "viewportSize": 1000,
          "viewportRatio": 0.5625,
          "theme": {
            "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
            "themeColors": [
              "#5b9bd5",
              "#ed7d31",
              "#a5a5a5",
              "#ffc000",
              "#4472c4"
            ],
            "fontColor": "#333333",
            "fontName": "Microsoft YaHei"
          },
          "elements": [
            {
              "id": "el_sU0DHl4z",
              "type": "text",
              "left": 60,
              "top": 50,
              "width": 880,
              "height": 55,
              "rotate": 0,
              "content": "<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#1e3a5f;\">求二次函数解析式（待定系数法）</span></strong></p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#1e3a5f",
              "lineHeight": 1.4,
              "paragraphSpace": 0,
              "textType": "title"
            },
            {
              "id": "el_3DeGqmis",
              "type": "text",
              "left": 60,
              "top": 120,
              "width": 880,
              "height": 200.20000000000002,
              "rotate": 0,
              "content": "<p><strong>易错点</strong>：① 不要忘记 $a \\neq 0$；② 设顶点式时注意顶点坐标的符号；③ 交点式仅适用于已知抛物线与 $x$ 轴交点的情况，且交点式展开后二次项系数仍为 $a$。</p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#333333",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "paragraphSpace": 6,
              "textType": "content"
            },
            {
              "id": "el_mxiIBLRE",
              "type": "text",
              "left": 60,
              "top": 330.20000000000005,
              "width": 880,
              "height": 200,
              "rotate": 0,
              "content": "<p>例题：### 例题 1（一般式 + 顶点式）</p><p><strong>题目</strong>：已知二次函数的图像经过点 $A(0, -3)$，$B(2, 5)$，$C(-1, -4)$，求该二次函数的解析式。</p><p><strong>【分析】</strong>：已知三个点，可设一般式 $y = ax^2 + bx + c$。</p><p><strong>【解答】</strong>：</p><p>1. 设解析式为 $y = ax^2 + bx + c$（$a \\neq 0$）。</p><p>2. 将各点坐标代入：</p><p>   $\\begin{cases} </p><p>   c = -3 &amp; \\text{(代入 A)} \\\\</p><p>   4a + 2b + c = 5 &amp; \\text{(代入 B)} \\\\</p><p>   a - b + c = -4 &amp; \\text{(代入 C)}</p><p>   \\end{cases}$</p><p>3. 将 $c = -3$ 代入后两式得：</p><p>   $\\begin{cases}</p><p>   4a + 2b - 3 = 5 \\\\</p><p>   a - b - 3 = -4</p><p>   \\end{cases}$</p><p>   整理得 $\\begin{cases} 4a + 2b = 8 \\\\ a - b = -1 \\end{cases}$</p><p>4. 解方程组：由第二式得 $a = b - 1$，代入第一式：$4(b-1) + 2b = 8$，$6b - 4 = 8$，$6b = 12$，$b = 2$，则 $a = 1$。</p><p>5. 所以解析式为 $y = x^2 + 2x - 3$。</p><p><strong>验证</strong>：顶点坐标 $(-1, -4)$？检查：当 $x = -1$ 时，$y = 1 - 2 - 3 = -4$，符合点 C，且对称轴为 $x = -1$，与点 $B(2,5)$ 对称吗？点 $B$ 关于 $x=-1$ 的对称点为 $(-4,5)$，未给出，但已知条件足够。</p><p><strong>变式</strong>：若条件改为“顶点为 $(-1, -4)$ 且经过点 $A(0, -3)$”，可用顶点式：设 $y = a(x+1)^2 - 4$，代入 $A$ 得 $a(0+1)^2 - 4 = -3 \\Rightarrow a = 1$，解析式相同。注意对比两种设法的优劣。</p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#334155",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "paragraphSpace": 4,
              "fill": "#f0f9ff",
              "textType": "content"
            }
          ],
          "background": {
            "type": "solid",
            "color": "#ffffff"
          },
          "type": "content"
        }
      },
      "createdAt": 1781591783153,
      "updatedAt": 1781591783153
