              "rotate": 0,
              "content": "<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#1e3a5f;\">求二次函数解析式（待定系数法）</span></strong></p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#1e3a5f",
              "lineHeight": 1.4,
              "paragraphSpace": 0,
              "textType": "title"
            },
            {
              "id": "el_ATnEgwp0",
              "type": "text",
              "left": 60,
              "top": 120,
              "width": 880,
              "height": 400,
              "rotate": 0,
              "content": "<p>### 方法总结</p><p>- <strong>已知任意三点</strong>（不在同一直线上） → 一般式</p><p>- <strong>已知顶点或对称轴、最值</strong> → 顶点式</p><p>- <strong>已知与 $x$ 轴两交点</strong> → 交点式</p><p>- 有时需要结合图形特征灵活选择，先求出一部分条件再转化。</p><p><strong>常见易错点汇总</strong>：</p><p>1. 设顶点式时顶点坐标符号：$y = a(x - h)^2 + k$，顶点 $(h, k)$，若顶点为 $(-1, 4)$，则表达式为 $y = a(x+1)^2 + 4$。</p><p>2. 代入计算时符号错误，尤其是乘法分配律。</p><p>3. 忘记 $a \\neq 0$ 条件导致方程无解或漏解。</p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#333333",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "paragraphSpace": 6,
              "textType": "content"
            }
          ],
          "background": {
            "type": "solid",
            "color": "#ffffff"
          },
          "type": "content"
        }
      },
