    {
      "id": "scene_fV567JWp",
      "stageId": "stage_5uTHCgHS",
      "type": "slide",
      "title": "图像平移与最值问题",
      "order": 13,
      "content": {
        "type": "slide",
        "canvas": {
          "id": "slide_2KpQwrmu",
          "viewportSize": 1000,
          "viewportRatio": 0.5625,
          "theme": {
            "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
            "themeColors": [
              "#5b9bd5",
              "#ed7d31",
              "#a5a5a5",
              "#ffc000",
              "#4472c4"
            ],
            "fontColor": "#333333",
            "fontName": "Microsoft YaHei"
          },
          "elements": [
            {
              "id": "el_GI0aiLTj",
              "type": "text",
              "left": 60,
              "top": 50,
              "width": 880,
              "height": 55,
              "rotate": 0,
              "content": "<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#1e3a5f;\">图像平移与最值问题</span></strong></p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#1e3a5f",
              "lineHeight": 1.4,
              "paragraphSpace": 0,
              "textType": "title"
            },
            {
              "id": "el_aNG5Qbda",
              "type": "text",
              "left": 60,
              "top": 120,
              "width": 880,
              "height": 400,
              "rotate": 0,
              "content": "<p>## 图像平移与最值问题</p><p>### 1. 图像的平移规律</p><p>二次函数的顶点式 $y = a(x - h)^2 + k$ 中，顶点坐标为 $(h, k)$。图像平移的规律为：<strong>左加右减，上加下减</strong>。即：</p><p>- 向左平移 $m$ 个单位：$x \\to x + m$；向右平移 $m$ 个单位：$x \\to x - m$（注意符号与平移方向相反）。</p><p>- 向上平移 $n$ 个单位：$k \\to k + n$；向下平移 $n$ 个单位：$k \\to k - n$。</p><p><strong>易错点</strong>：平移时容易混淆符号。例如，将 $y = x^2$ 向左平移 3 个单位，</p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#333333",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "paragraphSpace": 6,
              "textType": "content"
            }
          ],
          "background": {
            "type": "solid",
            "color": "#ffffff"
          },
          "type": "content"
        }
      },
      "createdAt": 1781591783153,
      "updatedAt": 1781591783153
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_O9su86iE",
      "stageId": "stage_5uTHCgHS",
      "type": "slide",
      "title": "图像平移与最值问题 (2)",
      "order": 14,
      "content": {
        "type": "slide",
        "canvas": {
          "id": "slide_eq2HbW8I",
          "viewportSize": 1000,
          "viewportRatio": 0.5625,
          "theme": {
            "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
            "themeColors": [
              "#5b9bd5",
              "#ed7d31",
              "#a5a5a5",
              "#ffc000",
              "#4472c4"
            ],
            "fontColor": "#333333",
            "fontName": "Microsoft YaHei"
          },
          "elements": [
            {
              "id": "el_7_c03qHg",
              "type": "text",
              "left": 60,
              "top": 50,
              "width": 880,
              "height": 55,
              "rotate": 0,
              "content": "<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#1e3a5f;\">图像平移与最值问题</span></strong></p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#1e3a5f",
              "lineHeight": 1.4,
              "paragraphSpace": 0,
              "textType": "title"
            },
            {
              "id": "el_KzG04Xzt",
              "type": "text",
              "left": 60,
              "top": 120,
              "width": 880,
              "height": 196.6,
              "rotate": 0,
              "content": "<p>应得到 $y = (x + 3)^2$（因为 $x$ 换成 $x+3$），而不是 $y = (x - 3)^2$。</p><p>变式：若平移前函数为一般式，可先化为顶点式，再应用规律。</p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#333333",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "paragraphSpace": 6,
              "textType": "content"
            },
            {
              "id": "el_FP-PiY3i",
              "type": "text",
              "left": 60,
              "top": 326.6,
              "width": 880,
              "height": 200,
              "rotate": 0,
              "content": "<p>例题：<strong>例1</strong>：将抛物线 $y = 2x^2 - 4x + 1$ 向左平移 2 个单位，再向上平移 3 个单位，求平移后的解析式。</p><p><strong>解</strong>：</p><p>1. 将原式化为顶点式：</p><p>   $$y = 2(x^2 - 2x) + 1 = 2[(x-1)^2 -1] + 1 = 2(x-1)^2 -1$$</p><p>   顶点坐标为 $(1, -1)$。</p><p>2. 向左平移 2 个单位：顶点横坐标 $1 \\to 1-2 = -1$（向左减横坐标？注意：实际上是顶点变为 $(-1, -1)$，因为 $x$ 替换为 $x+2$，新顶点横坐标满足 $x+2=1$，得 $x=-1$）。更直接：向左平移 2 单位，新顶点为 $(1-2, -1) = (-1, -1)$。</p><p>3. 再向上平移 3 个单位：纵坐标 $-1 \\to -1+3 = 2$，新顶点为 $(-1, 2)$。</p><p>4. 平移不改变 $a$ 值，所以新解析式为 $y = 2(x+1)^2 + 2$，展开得 $y = 2x^2 + 4x + 4$。</p><p><strong>变式训练</strong>：若将抛物线 $y = -\\frac{1}{2}x^2 - x + 1$ 向右平移 1 个单位，再向下平移 2 个单位，求新解析式。（提示：先化为顶点式 $y = -\\frac{1}{2}(x+1)^2 + \\frac{3}{2}$，平移后得 $y = -\\frac{1}{2}(x-0)^2 - \\frac{1}{2}$）</p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#334155",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "paragraphSpace": 4,
              "fill": "#f0f9ff",
              "textType": "content"
            }
          ],
          "background": {
            "type": "solid",
            "color": "#ffffff"
          },
          "type": "content"
        }
      },
      "createdAt": 1781591783153,
      "updatedAt": 1781591783153
